# Frontend design (Boletas Energía Mineral)

Keep the existing FastAPI + Jinja2 + vanilla CSS architecture. Do not add
React, Vue, Svelte, Tailwind, shadcn, or a Node build. UI component catalogs
are references, not dependencies.

Preserve routes, form field names, action values, Jinja variables, Spanish
copy, and backend behavior. Change presentation in `app/web/templates/` and
`app/web/static/style.css`; reuse tokens and semantic HTML (landmarks,
labels, fieldsets).

Avoid inline styles. JavaScript must stay local, optional, and must not
replace server form/link actions.

Verify keyboard use, mobile layout, contrast, and reduced-motion. After
frontend edits run the existing pytest suite with the SQLite `DATABASE_URL`
override from `AGENTS.md`.
